  Text: |
    This is a collection of example scripts to understand how to drive AnimationPlayer at runtime — tween curves, keyframes, material callbacks, finish events, and custom timestamp events. Toggle your favorite use case in the hierarchy and watch the motion play.
    
    Enable "enableLogging" on the script and refresh to see clip start, events, and finish in the logs.
    
    Disable this text object in the scene hierarchy to see the full scene.

